  m_text: "<size=140%>Turn-based battle!</size>\nYou can chant one spell on each
    of your turns.\nThe Demon Lord's element changes \nas his HP drops.\nWatch the
    <color=#FF5555>COLOR</color> of his HP bar!\n\nHitting him with a strong element
    heals you\nand can break the magic he is charging.\n\nIf minions appear, defeat
    them first!\nYou must defeat the Demon Lord within \n<size=120%>30 turns</size>.\n\nGood
    luck..."
